ces/open-llm-leaderboard/open_llm_leaderboard?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------#/', 'https://arxiv.org/html/2410.15665v1?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://www.gartner.com/en/articles/intelligent-agent-in-ai', 'https://www.ibm.com/think/insights/agentic-ai?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.04093?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://www.synthesia.io/', 'https://suno.com/', 'https://openai.com/sora/', 'https://deepmind.google/technologies/veo/veo-2/', 'https://openai.com/o1/', 'https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/reasoning?api-mode=responses', 'https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.16540?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://towardsdatascience.com/advanced-prompt-engineering-chain-of-thought-cot-8d8b090bf699', 'https://www.ijcai.org/proceedings/2024/0734.pdf', 'https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.04984?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://youtu.be/NNr6gPelJ3E', 'https://www.routledge.com/AI-Unexplainable-Unpredictable-Uncontrollable/Yampolskiy/p/book/9781032576268?srsltid=AfmBOoq7rJQCNFd7lhjAVYXDn3p4lnDGaULFI_8XMs83zfwyGLIb4TsB&source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://deepseekv3.org/', 'https://uk.finance.yahoo.com/news/deepseek-ai-replicated-just-30-122932711.html?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.12948?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://openai.com/index/introducing-deep-research/', 'https://www.perplexity.ai/', 'https://gemini.google/overview/deep-research/?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://transformer-circuits.pub/2025/attribution-graphs/biology.html?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://www.anthropic.com/research/tracing-thoughts-language-model?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/tecnosophia/chatgpt-and-llms-are-not-just-statistical-machines-0e4f5228ccab?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://modelcontextprotocol.io/introduction?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/tag/artificial-intelligence?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/tag/llm?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/tag/chatgpt?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/tag/data-science?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/tag/innovation?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/m/signin?actionUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2F_%2Fvote%2Fdata-bistrot%2F618a058c9fdf&operation=register&redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2Fdata-bistrot%2F15-artificial-intelligence-llm-trends-in-2024-618a058c9fdf&user=Gianpiero+Andrenacci&userId=c2313c94bfe7&source=---footer_actions--618a058c9fdf---------------------clap_footer------------------', 'https://medium.com/m/signin?actionUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2F_%2Fbookmark%2Fp%2F618a058c9fdf&operation=register&redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2Fdata-bistrot%2F15-artificial-intelligence-llm-trends-in-2024-618a058c9fdf&source=---footer_actions--618a058c9fdf---------------------bookmark_footer------------------', 'https://medium.com/data-bistrot?source=post_page---post_publication_info--618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/data-bistrot/followers?source=post_page---post_publication_info--618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/data-bistrot/docker-hello-world-building-running-and-debugging-bb211b5e9b85?source=post_page---post_publication_info--618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/@gianpiero.andrenacci?source=post_page---post_author_info--618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/@gianpiero.andrenacci/followers?source=post_page---post_author_info--618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/@gianpiero.andrenacci/following?source=post_page---post_author_info--618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://policy.medium.com/medium-rules-30e5502c4eb4?source=post_page---post_responses--618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/m/signin?operation=register&redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2Fdata-bistrot%2F15-artificial-intelligence-llm-trends-in-2024-618a058c9fdf&source=---post_responses--618a058c9fdf---------------------respond_sidebar------------------', 'https://help.medium.com/hc/en-us?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://status.medium.com/?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/about?autoplay=1&source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/jobs-at-medium/work-at-medium-959d1a85284e?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'mailto:pressinquiries@medium.com', 'https://blog.medium.com/?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://policy.medium.com/medium-privacy-policy-f03bf92035c9?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://policy.medium.com/medium-rules-30e5502c4eb4?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://policy.medium.com/medium-terms-of-service-9db0094a1e0f?source=post_page-----618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------