------bookmark_footer------------------', 'https://medium.com/data-bistrot?source=post_page---post_publication_info--618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/data-bistrot/followers?source=post_page---post_publication_info--618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/data-bistrot/docker-hello-world-building-running-and-debugging-bb211b5e9b85?source=post_page---post_publication_info--618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/@gianpiero.andrenacci?source=post_page---post_author_info--618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/@gianpiero.andrenacci/followers?source=post_page---post_author_info--618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/@gianpiero.andrenacci/following?source=post_page---post_author_info--618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://policy.medium.com/medium-rules-30e5502c4eb4?source=post_page---post_responses--618a058c9fdf---------------------------------------', 'https://medium.com/m/signin?operation=register&redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2Fdata-bistrot%2F15-artificial-intelligence-llm-trends-in-2024-618a058c9fdf&source=---post_responses--618a058c9fdf---------------------respond_sidebar------------------', 'https://medium.com/data-bistrot?source=post_page---author_recirc--618a058c9fdf----0---------------------cd6e22fc_8372_4472_82bf_47c806afeb3f--------------', 'https://medium.com/@gianpiero.andrenacci?source=post_page---author_recirc--618a058c9fdf----0---------------------cd6e22fc_8372_4472_82bf_47c806afeb3f--------------', 'https://medium.com/data-bistrot/abstraction-in-python-oop-c4da042f9eaf?source=post_page---author_recirc--618a058c9fdf----0---------------------cd6e22fc_8372_4472_82bf_47c806afeb3f--------------', 'https://medium.com/m/signin?actionUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2F_%2Fbookmark%2Fp%2Fc4da042f9eaf&operation=register&redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fmedium.com%2Fdata-bist